OL,3,ASerbia's veteran ruler VuDMiDG concedes
OL,4,Aelection to student-led protest
OL,5,Amovement
OL,6,
OL,7,FSerbia's long-standing leader
OL,8,FAleksandar VuDMiDG has admitted defeat
OL,9,Fto the student-led protest movement in
OL,10,Fsnap parliamentary elections.
OL,12,F"We still do not have final results...
OL,13,Fit is clear that we have lost these
OL,14,Felections," the right-wing populist
OL,15,Fleader said as he conceded late on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,18,FPreliminary figures provided by
OL,19,FSerbia's election commission indicated
OL,20,Fa record high turnout, which
OL,21,Fcommentators had suggested would favour
OL,22,Fthe student movement.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
